# ==============================================================================
# Rule Name: China-Direct (Custom)
# Description: Mainland China daily apps (WeChat, Taobao, JD, Xianyu, Douyin, Bilibili, LAN)
# Scope: High-frequency domestic Chinese applications, banking, payments, and private LAN subnets
# Note: Common WeChat (weixin.com, etc.) and JD domains are covered by upstream;
#       Custom retains additional top-tier apps, domestic payment gateways, and LAN ranges.
# ==============================================================================

# --- Tencent Services ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,qq.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tencent.com

# --- Alibaba / Taobao / Xianyu (Flea Market) ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,taobao.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tmall.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,alibaba.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,alicdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,aliexpress.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,aliyun.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,2.taobao.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,idlefish.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,alipay.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,alipayobjects.com
# Source: Loon log trace 2026-09-29 | Reason: Alibaba 1688 API, overseas DoH returned HK CDN (155.102.4.44) bypassing GeoIP
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,1688.com
# Source: 1688 client WebView container reset placeholder
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,blank_1688.com

# --- Other Mainland Services ---
# Douyin / ByteDance domestic ecosystem & CDNs
# [共享基础设施防护说明] bytedance.com / byteimg.com / ibytedtos.com 为国内抖音及飞书等共用底层。
# 现阶段为保障国内业务秒开保留在直连；未来若引入 TikTok 规则集，严禁将此类共享域名直接移入代理，
# 须保持 TikTok 独占域名（如 tiktok.com, byteoversea.com 等）在顶层代理，共享域名留在直连或做精准子域分流。
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,douyin.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bytedance.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,byteimg.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bytedns.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,zijieapi.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ibytedtos.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bytetos.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ecombdapi.com
